      "punte": [
        "fix: [taal] in 'Medisyne word ook hoog en toe weggebêre': 'hoog en toe weggebêre' is awkward and 'toe' can be misread as 'then'.",
        "fix: [taal] in 'Die klere kom uit terwyl': 'Die klere kom uit' is loose and does not plainly say the clothes are taken off.",
        "fix: [taal] in 'Stap nooit terug in vir iets': 'Stap nooit terug in vir iets' copies English 'go back in for something'.",
        "fix: [taal] in ''n Sterk skoonmaakgoed': 'skoonmaakgoed' is a collective noun and sits awkwardly after ''n'.",
        "check (the language finder raised this; it may not be a fault): 'Medisyne is 'n middel wat siekte of pyn behandel, of keer dat 'n mens ': This sentence restates the protected word-for-word definition of 'medisyne' but drops 'help om ... te' (the protection's reason stresses that medicine HELPS). Not changed, because it touches a decided shared definition; a person or the writer should decide whether the study text must match the glossary wording.",
        "check (the language finder raised this; it may not be a fault): 'Die merk of plakker op 'n houer wat sê wat binne-in is.': The protected entry withdrew 'die etiket sê wat' because a refilled bottle keeps its old label, which is this lesson's main example; this definition states that the label says what is inside. Not the withdrawn words exactly, so not a safety flag, but the meaning sits close to it and may contradict the lesson's own point. Content decision, not changed.",
        "check (the language finder raised this; it may not be a fault): 'Spoel die vel en die oog altwee ten minste vyftien tot twintig minute ': 'ten minste' with a range ('vyftien tot twintig') is logically unclear: the minimum is one number. Fixing it needs the intended duration, which is a safety fact, so it is left for the writer."
      ]
